<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="no">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Kuhan Vimalan - Mine Interesser</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f2027, #203a43, #2c5364);
            color: #fff;
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 2rem;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 800px;
            width: 100%;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 3rem;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
        }
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }
        .header p {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }
        .interests-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }
        .interest-card {
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            transition: transform 0.2s, background 0.2s;
        }
        .interest-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
        }
        .interest-card .icon {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.7rem;
        }
        .interest-card h3 {
            font-size: 1.15rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
        }
        .interest-card p {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            opacity: 0.75;
            line-height: 1.4;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 2.5rem;
            opacity: 0.6;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Kuhan Vimalan</h1>
            <p>Systemutvikler &mdash; Mine Interesser</p>
        </div>

        <div class="interests-grid">
            <div class="interest-card">
                <div class="icon">💻</div>
                <h3>Programmering</h3>
                <p>Elsker å bygge webapplikasjoner med C#, .NET, Blazor og React.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="interest-card">
                <div class="icon">🏋️</div>
                <h3>Trening</h3>
                <p>Holder meg aktiv med styrketrening og løping.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="interest-card">
                <div class="icon">🎮</div>
                <h3>Gaming</h3>
                <p>Liker å spille strategispill og utforske nye titler.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="interest-card">
                <div class="icon">📚</div>
                <h3>Læring</h3>
                <p>Alltid nysgjerrig – leser om teknologi, UX-design og nye rammeverk.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="interest-card">
                <div class="icon">🌍</div>
                <h3>Reise</h3>
                <p>Liker å oppleve nye kulturer og steder.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="interest-card">
                <div class="icon">☕</div>
                <h3>Kaffe</h3>
                <p>En god kopp kaffe er den beste starten på dagen.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="qr-section" style="text-align:center; margin-top:2.5rem;">
            <h3 style="margin-bottom:0.8rem;">📱 Scan for å dele denne siden</h3>
            <img id="qrCode" alt="QR-kode til denne siden"
                 style="width:180px; height:180px; border-radius:10px; background:#fff; padding:8px;" />
            <p style="opacity:0.6; font-size:0.85rem; margin-top:0.5rem;">Del med venner og arbeidsgivere!</p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>Scannet fra CV-en min &bull; Kuhan Vimalan &bull; kuhan2001@hotmail.com</p>
        </div>

    <script>
        // Genererer QR-kode som peker til denne sidens URL
        const pageUrl = encodeURIComponent(window.location.href);
        document.getElementById('qrCode').src =
            `https://api.qrserver.com/v1/create-qr-code/?size=180x180&data=${pageUrl}`;
    </script>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
